X-PUBLISHED-TTL:P1D
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-mon-gym@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260914T063000
DTEND:20260914T071500
SUMMARY:Gym — Strength
DESCRIPTION:Full-body strength: compound lifts (squat\, deadlift\, press\, row) + core/stability. Base phase = hypertrophy (3x8-10). Build/Peak = power + single-leg/injury-proofing (3x4-6\, plyo). Keep it short and crisp before work — this protects your run/bike volume\, not compete with it.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-mon-swim@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260914T180000
DTEND:20260914T184500
SUMMARY:Swim (fun session)
DESCRIPTION:Easy\, technique-first swim. Your fun session — drills + relaxed continuous swimming\, build toward race-pace continuous efforts as the year goes. No need to hammer\; smooth > fast.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-tue-run@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260915T180000
DTEND:20260915T183000
SUMMARY:Run — Quality
DESCRIPTION:Evening quality run: easy or hills/strides depending on the week — keep effort controlled\, this is not a race.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-wed-gym@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260916T063000
DTEND:20260916T071500
SUMMARY:Gym — Strength
DESCRIPTION:Full-body strength: compound lifts (squat\, deadlift\, press\, row) + core/stability. Base phase = hypertrophy (3x8-10). Build/Peak = power + single-leg/injury-proofing (3x4-6\, plyo). Keep it short and crisp before work — this protects your run/bike volume\, not compete with it.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-wed-bike@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260916T173000
DTEND:20260916T181500
SUMMARY:Bike — Intervals
DESCRIPTION:Evening quality ride: warm up 10min\, then tempo/threshold intervals\, cool down. Effort by feel (RPE) since it is dark/indoor-trainer-friendly territory.
END:VEVENT
