BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-sat-bike@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20260919T070000
DTEND:20260919T083000
SUMMARY:Long Ride
DESCRIPTION:Weekly long ride — the single most important IM-bike session. Steady aerobic pace (conversational)\, practice race nutrition (carbs/hour) and aero position. Scheduled midday since duration exceeds the evening window.
END:VEVENT
