DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20270603T180000
DTEND:20270603T190500
SUMMARY:Run — Quality
DESCRIPTION:Evening quality run: easy or hills/strides depending on the week — keep effort controlled\, this is not a race.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w38-fri-gym@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20270604T063000
DTEND:20270604T071500
SUMMARY:Gym — Strength
DESCRIPTION:Full-body strength: compound lifts (squat\, deadlift\, press\, row) + core/stability. Base phase = hypertrophy (3x8-10). Build/Peak = power + single-leg/injury-proofing (3x4-6\, plyo). Keep it short and crisp before work — this protects your run/bike volume\, not compete with it.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w38-fri-bike@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235100Z
DTSTART:20270604T173000
DTEND:20270604T185500
SUMMARY:Bike — Intervals
DESCRIPTION:Evening quality ride: warm up 10min\, then tempo/threshold intervals\, cool down. Effort by feel (RPE) since it is dark/indoor-trainer-friendly territory.
END:VEVENT
